p class=\"iq-jrev3__q\">&bdquo;Brilliantly designed side pockets for treats and a big back pocket.&ldquo;</p>\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__m\">Multifunction Jacket 3.0 &middot; Verified purchase</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"iq-jrev3__c\">\n    {{ j3stars }}\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__q\">&bdquo;I used to carry several jackets and pull a vest over them. With this jacket, that's finally over. Highly recommended!&ldquo;</p>\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__m\"><b>Dirk</b> &middot; Training Jacket 2.0 &middot; Verified purchase</p>\n  </div>\n\n{%- else -%}\n  <div class=\"iq-jrev3__c\">\n    {{ j3stars }}\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__q\">&bdquo;H&auml;lt warm, vertr&auml;gt Regen und Schnee, h&auml;lt jeden Sprung vom Mali stand.&ldquo;</p>\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__m\">Multifunktionsjacke 3.0 &middot; Verifizierter Kauf</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"iq-jrev3__c\">\n    {{ j3stars }}\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__q\">&bdquo;Mega durchdachte Seitentaschen f&uuml;r Leckerlies und gro&szlig;e R&uuml;ckentasche.&ldquo;</p>\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__m\">Multifunktionsjacke 3.0 &middot; Verifizierter Kauf</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"iq-jrev3__c\">\n    {{ j3stars }}\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__q\">&bdquo;Fr&uuml;her habe ich immer mehrere Jacken dabei gehabt und dann ne Weste dr&uuml;ber gezogen. Das ist mit dieser Jacke endlich vorbei. Nur zu empfehlen!&ldquo;</p>\n    <p class=\"iq-jrev3__m\"><b>Dirk</b> &middot; Trainingsjacke 2.0 &middot; Verifizierter Kauf</p>\n  </div>\n{%- endif -%}\n\n</div>"
